      362.11,
      455.5,
      400.82
    ],
    "text": "Clause 2 : This clause amends the Code of Criminal Procedure (Special Provisions) Act,No. 2 of 2013 by inserting section 6A in that Act and the legal effect of the amendment is tomake provisions to ensure the rights of an Attorney-at-Law who represents a person held inthe police custody.",
