      "Times"
    ],
    "sizes": [
      10.0
    ]
  },
  {
    "page_number": 3,
    "bbox": [
      211.15,
      203.45,
      397.2,
      240.11
    ],
    "text": "shall, be treated cordially and courteously, andbe given a fair and patient hearing by the policeofficers attached to such police station.",
    "fonts": [
      "Times"
    ],
    "sizes": [
      10.0
    ]
  },
  {
    "page_number": 3,
    "bbox": [
      211.15,
      254.21,
      397.19,
      316.31
    ],
    "text": "(4) Any such Attorney-at-Law shall, onbehalf of the person being held in policecustody, be entitled to meet the officer incharge of the police station and ascertain fromsuch officer the following information:\u2013",
    "fonts": [
      "Times"
    ],
    "sizes": [
      10.0
    ]
  },
  {
    "page_number": 3,
    "bbox": [
      232.87,
      330.41,
      397.17,
      354.47
    ],
    "text": "(a)offence alleged to have beencommitted by such person;",
    "fonts": [
      "Times",
      "TimesNewRoman,Italic"
    ],
    "sizes": [
      10.0
    ]
  },
  {
    "page_number": 3,
    "bbox": [
      232.87,
      368.45,
      397.17,
      392.51
    ],
    "text": "(b)date, time and location of the arrestof such person;",
    "fonts": [
      "Times",
      "TimesNewRoman,Italic"
    ],
    "sizes": [
      10.0
    ]
  },
  {
    "page_number": 3,
    "bbox": [
      233.71,
      406.61,
      397.19,
      443.27
    ],
    "text": "(c)date, approximate time and place ofproducing such person before aMagistrate; and",
    "fonts": [
      "Times",
      "TimesNewRoman,Italic"
    ],
    "sizes": [
      10.0
    ]
  },
  {
    "page_number": 3,
    "bbox": [
      232.87,
      457.37,
      397.19,
      506.87
    ],
    "text": "(d)any other information, the revealingof which would not adversely affectthe conduct of further investigationsand the interests of justice.",
    "fonts": [
      "Times",
      "TimesNewRoman,Italic"
    ],
    "sizes": [
      10.0
    ]
  },
  {
    "page_number": 3,
    "bbox": [
      211.15,
      520.85,
      397.17,
      544.91
    ],
    "text": "(5) Any such Attorney-at-Law shall beentitled to\u2013",
    "fonts": [
      "Times"
    ],
    "sizes": [
      10.0
    ]
  },
  {
    "page_number": 3,
    "bbox": [
      232.87,
      559.01,
      397.16,
      595.67
    ],
    "text": "(a)make representations on behalf ofsuch person, to the officer in chargeof the police station; and",
    "fonts": [
      "Times",
      "TimesNewRoman,Italic"
    ],
    "sizes": [
      10.0
    ]
  },
  {
    "page_number": 3,
    "bbox": [
      232.87,
      609.77,
      397.22,
      671.87
    ],
    "text": "(b)make an application to the officer incharge of the police station, seekingthe grant of bail for such person interms of section 6 of the Bail Act,No. 30 of 1997.",
    "fonts": [
      "Times",
      "TimesNewRoman,Italic"
    ],
    "sizes": [
      10.0
    ]
  },
  {
    "page_number": 3,
    "bbox": [
      140.71,
      342.41,
      151.15,
      353.75
    ],
    "text": "10",
    "fonts": [
      "Times"
    ],
    "sizes": [
      10.0
    ]
  },
  {
