  },
  {
    "page_number": 4,
    "bbox": [
      215.85,
      202.97,
      401.89,
      262.31
    ],
    "text": "(6) Such Attorney-at-Law shall, if he sorequests, be allowed to have access to theperson in custody, unless such access isprejudicial to the investigation beingconducted.",
    "fonts": [
      "Times"
    ],
    "sizes": [
      10.0
    ]
  },
  {
    "page_number": 4,
    "bbox": [
      215.85,
      274.97,
      401.88,
      310.31
    ],
    "text": "(7) Where such Attorney-at-Law makes,representations or, an application undersubsection (5), such officer shall\u2013",
    "fonts": [
      "Times"
    ],
    "sizes": [
      10.0
    ]
  },
  {
    "page_number": 4,
    "bbox": [
      237.57,
      322.97,
      401.87,
      346.31
    ],
    "text": "(a)make a record of the representationsso made;",
    "fonts": [
      "Times",
      "TimesNewRoman,Italic"
    ],
    "sizes": [
      10.0
    ]
  },
  {
    "page_number": 4,
    "bbox": [
      237.57,
      358.97,
      401.87,
      382.31
    ],
    "text": "(b)give due consideration to suchrepresentations; and",
    "fonts": [
      "Times",
      "TimesNewRoman,Italic"
    ],
    "sizes": [
      10.0
    ]
  },
  {
    "page_number": 4,
    "bbox": [
      238.29,
      394.97,
      401.86,
      418.31
    ],
    "text": "(c)record reasons for the grant or refusalof such application seeking bail.",
    "fonts": [
      "Times",
      "TimesNewRoman,Italic"
    ],
    "sizes": [
      10.0
    ]
  },
  {
    "page_number": 4,
    "bbox": [
      215.85,
      430.97,
      401.89,
      490.31
    ],
    "text": "(8) Every officer in charge of a police stationshall, if he is not in a position to entertainrepresentations made by an Attorney-at-Law,under this section, appoint a suitable policeofficer to entertain such representations.",
    "fonts": [
      "Times"
    ],
    "sizes": [
      10.0
    ]
  },
  {
    "page_number": 4,
    "bbox": [
      215.85,
      502.97,
      401.89,
      562.31
    ],
    "text": "(9) For the purposes of this section theexpression \u201cofficer in charge of a policestation\u201d includes any other police officerrepresenting such officer in charge of the policestation.\u201d.",
    "fonts": [
      "Times"
    ],
    "sizes": [
      10.0
    ]
  },
  {
    "page_number": 4,
    "bbox": [
      161.85,
      574.97,
      401.9,
      598.31
    ],
